  "summary": "The customer requests modifications to Jira Software 8.20 workflows to align with new company policies regarding ticket prioritization and dynamic adjustments based on project status and goals.",
  "customer_request": "We need to adjust the prioritization settings within Jira to reflect our new company policies. Specifically, we want to create a customized priority field that aligns with our updated prioritization matrix and implement a feature that allows for dynamic adjustments based on the real-time status of issues and overarching project goals. We also need to ensure that our projects are managed more efficiently by allowing team members to categorize issues with the appropriate level of urgency as dictated by our new policy framework. Please provide guidance on the best approach for implementing these workflow modifications.",
  "missing_information": ["The approved list of priority names, definitions, and intended order from highest to lowest urgency.", "Which projects are affected?", "Whether the customer uses a staging environment.", "Who has Jira administrator access to make the change safely.", "Whether issue priority should influence automation or workflow behavior.", "Exact configuration screens or plugins required for the basic priority list change."]
}
